WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:07.320
You need yarn in four colors, cut into 20 pieces about five centimeters long.

2
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:10.060
Mark out a patch of lawn about two meters square.

3
00:00:10.883 --> 00:00:14.563
While your child turns away, scatter all 20 worms on top of the grass.

4
00:00:14.983 --> 00:00:17.223
Say go, and give 30 seconds to hunt.

5
00:00:17.623 --> 00:00:18.623
Then count each color.

6
00:00:19.367 --> 00:00:21.347
The red and yellow worms usually go first.

7
00:00:21.927 --> 00:00:23.367
Green and brown ones are often left.

8
00:00:23.867 --> 00:00:25.347
Then try bare dirt or a rug.

9
00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:28.090
Stay with your child the whole time.

10
00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:33.490
Count every piece back and keep looking until all 20 are found, because pets can

11
00:00:33.490 --> 00:00:34.570
swallow loose yarn.
